    <string name="how_to_play">How to play</string>
    <string name="how_to_play_rules">You both start with 20 points. 10 cards go up for auction, one at a time.\n\nThe opener must bid. Then raise by 1, 2 or 5, or pass and the other player takes the card at their last bid.\n\nRatings stay hidden. You see yours when you win a card and your rival's at the end.\n\nThe higher total rating wins.\n\nDefault rules: each player ends with exactly 5 cards. As the opener you may hand a card you do not want over to your rival, who must then open it. Your first hand-over costs 1 point, the next 2, then 3.</string>
